{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_12", "source_id": "6846b033000000002202402d", "title": "油痘敏肌爱用面膜！用了就离不开了~", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6846b033000000002202402d", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1213, "evidence_unit_count": 38, "original_evidence_unit_count": 38, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 125, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天是一期爱用面膜分享 我做博主这么久", "抹布做的最软 最浮贴的 我之前用过一些其他品牌的 他们的开孔设计", "很多时候我都是一边敷它一边熬夜 但是我早上起来照镜子的时候", "我酸动魔内部也是用的它 它就会比一些低浓度的酸的 效果来得更好", "后续再用一些护肤品的时候 也会很好吸收进去", "所以可以很温和的 帮我们打开皮肤通道 再把一些很厉害的成分", "我很少给大家分享面膜 因为身面上很多的面膜我都不喜欢用 我觉得敷他们的时候"], "retained_quotes": ["所以可以很温和的 帮我们打开皮肤通道 再把一些很厉害的成分", "我很少给大家分享面膜 因为身面上很多的面膜我都不喜欢用 我觉得敷他们的时候"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6846b033000000002202402d/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6846b033000000002202402d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6846b033000000002202402d/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6846b033000000002202402d/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "32b202a6bbecc5f8317d1dfc11eb8ae2ce82ef3b68220496cb888fe854233292", "card_hash": "9f5dd5e99e987c5420b4b3440dc3d18877f1ecd93a7ecf4c290ee00c53735933", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_12", "source_id": "6844fe5600000000200299b1", "title": "4min痘肌早晚护肤跟练", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6844fe5600000000200299b1", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1646, "evidence_unit_count": 47, "original_evidence_unit_count": 47, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 151, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["哈嘍 我是小帶零 今天分享一個可以幫我們 由豆雞去豆以及蛋豆印的", "擦我們的後背 還有前兄你們一些愛長豆的地方 用這一步 它的目的是為了幫我們", "我就跟你們簡單的介紹一下它 它是我們這個去豆的 早晚間護膚的凍頭戲", "紅色豆印多需要修護壓紅 你們就選綠洲 它可以抗很多豆機長豆", "就跟大家分享完了 大家試完之後記得在評論區跟我留言 或者還有什麼不明白的地方 也可以在評論區問我", "但是你們按照我的這個方法來用 吸收完之後是非常的乾爽 你們也可以先用兩蹦塗全淚", "豆豆豆印就少了 那用完它之後我會再看情況 在後面疊一個綠洲精華或者是星光精華"], "retained_quotes": ["但是你們按照我的這個方法來用 吸收完之後是非常的乾爽 你們也可以先用兩蹦塗全淚", "豆豆豆印就少了 那用完它之後我會再看情況 在後面疊一個綠洲精華或者是星光精華"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6844fe5600000000200299b1/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6844fe5600000000200299b1/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6844fe5600000000200299b1/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6844fe5600000000200299b1/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b1dd0ac4ca9355b0315c659248f5065772325034d865fd966a5e71b890c25a46", "card_hash": "944de69f11c0af46c32d6adea0e1ad38c254392edbaf75d66c03afb4dc2ad512", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_12", "source_id": "682d782c0000000020029a1a", "title": "恢复皮肤屏障原来这么简单（脆敏肌）", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_682d782c0000000020029a1a", "topic_family": "敏感维稳与红黑脸", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1196, "evidence_unit_count": 37, "original_evidence_unit_count": 37, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 130, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小贝琳 今天给你们分享一套 我亲测下来很有效的", "重复两三次就可以了 然后在这种鼻子这边 如果是用比较猛的话", "而且修不离很好 我从去年入坑之后 只要皮肤有什么问题 我就会连续用它用了几天", "我们可以稍微的在脸上 打圈轻轻的打圈 因为现在脸上很滑 就算打圈也不会伤害它", "也觉得好厉害呀 这一套流程 你们可以收藏起来 这样之后敏的时候 就不怕找到了", "最后它还有一点 这种微微的深韧的状态 我们就可以轻微的 再涂一点", "再加一点 在手心搓开之后就按压上面 我们在皮肤米的时候 尽量不要去那么搓脸"], "retained_quotes": ["最后它还有一点 这种微微的深韧的状态 我们就可以轻微的 再涂一点", "再加一点 在手心搓开之后就按压上面 我们在皮肤米的时候 尽量不要去那么搓脸"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_682d782c0000000020029a1a/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_682d782c0000000020029a1a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_682d782c0000000020029a1a/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_682d782c0000000020029a1a/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "8c87fd76ddd78d823b39238e83b7c2585c24c02185ccb3ae630dc7fdc77355fb", "card_hash": "5c07b9b8a85ef040a130f78b4ebc193bd7c48aabc00262cff6534aba30b2cd67", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
